# Shell scripts must stay LF: they run in WSL/CI bash, which rejects CRLF.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Byte-exact fixtures and goldens. Git's own binary detection already gets
# these right (they are full of NULs), but the whole point of a parity golden
# is that not one byte moves, and `core.autocrlf` is on for this repo — so say
# it rather than rely on a heuristic.
*.bin binary
*.rgb565 binary
